WEBVTT

00:07:28.276 --> 00:07:30.076
Yay, exactly.

00:07:30.116 --> 00:07:32.236
Any more of those in the room? Yeah.

00:07:33.396 --> 00:07:35.276
Tell us, from your viewpoint,

00:07:35.316 --> 00:07:38.156
how do you think about this question
of climate justice?

00:07:38.796 --> 00:07:41.036
JD: You know, when you think about it,

00:07:41.036 --> 00:07:42.956
climate justice,

00:07:42.996 --> 00:07:47.516
climate change, amplifies inequities.

00:07:48.196 --> 00:07:49.956
Those who suffer the most

00:07:49.956 --> 00:07:52.756
have done the least to cause this problem.

00:07:53.156 --> 00:07:56.476
(Applause)

00:07:57.196 --> 00:07:59.396
And what that means is that the US,

00:07:59.436 --> 00:08:02.716
as the world's historic biggest emitter,